WEBVTT

00:42.202 --> 00:46.483
The walls are cold, the air is thin. The noise

00:46.623 --> 00:51.704
outside is closing in. I'm running from the face

00:51.984 --> 00:57.165
I see. The victims say they made of me. This rage

00:57.345 --> 01:04.543
is just a heavy stone. A brotherly act. Shedding

01:04.563 --> 01:10.852
skin, shedding weight Escaping from this world

01:11.173 --> 01:15.259
of rage

01:21.596 --> 01:25.417
I see a light in the endless black A signal

01:25.497 --> 01:29.478
calling, no turning back The pull of the old

01:29.518 --> 01:35.479
world fades away A new horizon, a new day I'm

01:35.519 --> 01:41.381
climbing, climbing Past the point of no return

01:41.401 --> 01:48.782
I'm flying, flying With the fire I let burn Just a

01:48.842 --> 01:53.364
single distant light Burning through the

01:53.444 --> 01:57.668
endless night And I strive

02:21.335 --> 02:25.896
I'm floating now, the engine's off The silence

02:26.236 --> 02:31.738
is a holy sound The rage is gone, the fear is lost

02:31.818 --> 02:37.059
In this new universe I found I'm loved by the sun,

02:37.379 --> 02:43.481
I'm held by the void An orbit just begun A life not

02:43.521 --> 02:47.285
destroyed and the stars are singing a song I

02:47.545 --> 02:56.133
understand I'm finally, finally reaching for

02:56.153 --> 02:57.214
your hand

04:07.833 --> 04:11.415
The walls are gone

04:14.998 --> 04:19.361
The air is clear

04:22.063 --> 04:28.107
There is no noise

04:28.147 --> 04:31.169
There is no fear

04:37.253 --> 04:38.294
I'm not strong I'm not strong

